  title: "The 1.5 \xB0C target"
  body: "Under the Paris Agreement, countries aim to limit global warming to 1.5
    \xB0C above pre-industrial levels. Beyond that, impacts such as stronger typhoons,
    floods and heat waves become far more severe. The temperature bar in this game
    tracks that limit."
